
# AUTHENTICATION

### Register Admin
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin1",
  "email": "admin@terraguide.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "role": "admin",
  "fullName": "Admin User",
  "address": "Balayan, Batangas"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

  {
    "username": "admin1",
    "password": "Password123!"
  }

### Get Current User Profile
GET http://localhost:5000/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>


# BUYER PREFERENCES

### Get Buyer Preferences
GET http://localhost:5000/api/preferences
Authorization: Bearer <BUYER_TOKEN>

### Save / Update Buyer Preferences
POST http://localhost:5000/api/preferences
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <BUYER_TOKEN>

{
  "preferredLocation": "Balayan",
  "preferredType": "Agricultural",
  "minBudget": 1000000,
  "maxBudget": 5000000,
  "minLotSize": 1000
}



# PROPERTY EXPLORER (PUBLIC)

### Get All Listings
GET http://localhost:5000/api/properties

### Get Property by ID
GET http://localhost:5000/api/properties/PROPERTY_ID_HERE

### Keyword Search
GET http://localhost:5000/api/properties?search=balayan

### Filter by Location
GET http://localhost:5000/api/properties?location=Balayan

### Filter by Type
GET http://localhost:5000/api/properties?type=Agricultural

### Filter by Status
GET http://localhost:5000/api/properties?status=Available

### Price and Lot Size Filter
GET http://localhost:5000/api/properties?minPrice=1000000&maxPrice=5000000&minLotSize=500

### Sort Latest First
GET http://localhost:5000/api/properties?sort=latest

### Sort Price Low to High
GET http://localhost:5000/api/properties?sort=priceAsc

### Sort Price High to Low
GET http://localhost:5000/api/properties?sort=priceDesc

### Pagination
GET http://localhost:5000/api/properties?page=1&limit=5

### Combined Search
GET http://localhost:5000/api/properties?location=Balayan&type=Agricultural&minPrice=1000000&sort=priceAsc&page=1&limit=10



# PROPERTY ADMIN OPERATIONS

### Create New Property
POST http://localhost:5000/api/properties
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <ADMIN_TOKEN>

{
  "title": "Sample Agricultural Lot",
  "description": "Ideal for farming and investment.",
  "location": "Balayan",
  "type": "Agricultural",
  "status": "Available",
  "price": 2500000,
  "lotSize": 1500,
  "ownerName": "Juan Dela Cruz"
}

### Update Property
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/properties/PROPERTY_ID_HERE
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <ADMIN_TOKEN>

{
  "price": 3000000,
  "status": "Reserved"
}

### Delete Property
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/properties/PROPERTY_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer <ADMIN_TOKEN>